t page  followed by html and css we have the  javascript  javascript is an extremely important  technology that every web developer  should learn most of the popular web  frameworks like react.js  and node.js are built upon the  javascript  javascript makes the web applications a  love by adding interactivity and dynamic  updating of web applications  followed by javascript we have the  typescript  typescript can be considered as an  extension of javascript  angular uses typescript as a space  language  it adds type safety to javascript to  cache errors in the development phase  it also helps in developing object  oriented code for javascript  so followed by typescript we have the  angular  angular is a web framework used to  create a single phase  applications it is backed by google  therefore learning angular is a good  choice for a modern  web developer so followed by angular  we have react js react is a popular  library for developing fast and  responsive web applications  it is backed by facebook and quite  popular because of its simplicity and  performance  it allows you to create a reusable  components that can be used to create  modern web applications so followed by  react.js we have  view js view is like other frontend  frameworks that is used for building  user interfaces it is comparatively  easier to integrate  view with other libraries or existing  projects  it is a newer framework but it has  really picked up speed last year and  being adopted  more now followed by the front-end  developer we have the back-end  developers  so back-end development is more about  caring how application works and  ensure that it keeps running smoothly  let's go ahead and know more about this  field of web development  there are a few things that you must  learn for becoming a back-end developer  let us discuss those things  so the first one is the node.js node.js  is a javascript runtime  built on chrome's v8 javascript engine  it allows you to develop a complete web  application using javascript  it is best suited to be used for web  applications in conjunction with  javascript frameworks like  react.js so followed by node.js we have  python  python is a popular language used in  various fields of tech applications  django is a backend framework based on  python used for server-side scripting  it is also known for its speed and  efficiency python is also  easy to get started with programming  language if this is your first time  coding  followed by python we have java  java has been the most used language for  a long time  it is primarily used for back-end  development you can either use core java  or java with a spring boot for high  performance back-end  next we have next we have ruby  ruby is a dynamic programming language  that focuses  mainly on simplicity it has a syntax  that is very easy to read and close to  english language phrases  the web framework ruby on rails is  popularly used for developing packing  systems  so followed by ruby we have php and  mysql  php although treated as a hard to learn  language  is still the easiest way to write server  side code  at least 50 percent of the internet runs  on php and mysql  mysql is the most popular database for  storing data  of a web application now followed by the  backend developer we will enter  the next important stage of web  development roadmap in 2021  that is about the web developers salary  trends  let's now have a look on the salary  trends of a web developer  web developers are always in demand  since new web applications are launched  and managed continuously they are  generally offered  generous salaries across the globe  salaries also depend on the types of web  developers  for instance full stack developers are  paid more than the front-end and  back-end developers  the average salary of a web developer in  india is 3 lakh 86 000 per annum  the average salary of a web developer in  the united states is 68  524 us dollars per annum there you go  we have discus